# Wave T51 (Astral kit): moonfloor — Astral Town's registered street kind (the fleet's street kinds carry the -floor suffix; the desire-path tiers key on it). MOONSTONE FLAGS: large irregular pale-lavender moonstone flags, two by two to a tile, with dark violet grout and a tiny star fleck on each flag face — the oldest streets in Borea, laid for the shrine town in the mountain's lap. A PALE FLAG FIELD: unlike Heritage's heritagefloor (worn teal-green flagstone, cross-hatched), Shardfall's shardfloor (dark cracked slate), Repose's pebblefloor (small rounded pebbles), Inglenook's giltfloor (gold-ochre setts) and Bridgeport's ringfloor (blue-grey quay flags with an iron ring inlay — a harbour register): Astral's flags are lavender moonstone with violet grout and star flecks, a shrine register. (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T51-ASTRAL-PLAN.md §5.)
